[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11103.03, "timestamp": "03:05:03", "text": "我当时想，也许我应该去参加一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11105.59, "timestamp": "03:05:05", "text": "比如唱歌课程之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11108.469, "timestamp": "03:05:08", "text": "因为我更感兴趣的是日语。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11110.87, "timestamp": "03:05:10", "text": "现在有了音乐，我就想，嗯，也许我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11113.429, "timestamp": "03:05:13", "text": "走吧。是的。是的。是的。云"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11116.15, "timestamp": "03:05:16", "text": "还有一些其他的东西。太多事情了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11120.389, "timestamp": "03:05:20", "text": "我想，这会是一次难忘的经历吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11126.71, "timestamp": "03:05:26", "text": "奇数环。啊，这是什么？这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11129.51, "timestamp": "03:05:29", "text": "动画片。啊，我真的很喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11138.23, "timestamp": "03:05:38", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11141.91, "timestamp": "03:05:41", "text": "哦，美联储。哦，还有那首歌。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11143.51, "timestamp": "03:05:43", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11149.83, "timestamp": "03:05:49", "text": "动画效果真的非常棒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11153.269, "timestamp": "03:05:53", "text": "是的，真的很好。"}]